cron_core-1.3.0/lib/puppet/...   the release openvox 8.33.0 vendors
cron_core-2.1.0/lib/puppet/...   the release SIMP pins (tests/spine/simp/modules.pin)
Each holds puppet/type/cron.rb, puppet/provider/cron/crontab.rb and
puppet/provider/cron/filetype.rb.

Do not edit: TestFixturesMatchManifest requires each file's sha256 to equal the
digest in ../manifest.go.
